WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.656
To put concrete numbers on it: on ListOps,

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:07.410
Reformer earns a masked-validation-drop score of
eleven point eight five,

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:11.383
dwarfing every other attention's score of under
half a point,

00:00:11.463 --> 00:00:13.728
a strikingly clean selection signal.

00:00:13.808 --> 00:00:17.766
On document matching, the best homogeneous model,
Synthesizer,

00:00:17.846 --> 00:00:20.241
reaches seventy-one point one percent,

00:00:20.321 --> 00:00:27.666
while the heterogeneous NAS Prune and NAS One-shot
models trail at sixty-seven and sixty-four point seven percent.

00:00:27.746 --> 00:00:33.463
On text classification the best homogeneous
Performer hits sixty-four point five percent,

00:00:33.543 --> 00:00:36.850
and again neither heterogeneous variant edges ahead.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:41.800
Across nine attention mechanisms and three tasks,
the pattern is consistent.
